# Normalize line endings for everyone regardless of OS/editor settings.
# Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) shows every text
# file as "modified" against a repo cloned/edited on Linux or macOS, even
# with byte-identical content — as happened when comparing a local Windows
# checkout against the GitHub clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
